{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1300.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b6893c4dc2f90ecf572b18980c653b383d817bbe0c20ce969283a0717d8529be","ja":"さすがは世界が認めたプロダンサーチームね……。","zh":"不愧是获得世界认可的专业舞团呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1300.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4563d065468157ac531bdd23fc636ec5cae17329a6e9e64bcff12bc7a1391b2a","ja":"わ、私たちのダンスだって負けてないはずですよ！\n今まで以上に練習したら……。","zh":"我、我们的舞蹈也肯定不会输的！\n只要比以往更加努力练习的话……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1300.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a03e2efd63ad76ac2b9a99712ead1b9f8e62dfe0f44365191372c7b44c648fa9","ja":"でも、このままじゃ厳しいかもな。\nだからさ……。","zh":"但是，照这样下去恐怕会很吃力吧。\n所以说……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1300.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"fde1e00f55c4a19f1582f83c111f24a4980b55532fe756c4781a2427c31aa7f4","ja":"オレたちは歌も歌って、できることを\n全部使って戦うっていうのはどうかな？","zh":"我们也可以唱歌，把能做的事情\n全都用上放手一搏，这样你觉得怎么样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1300.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"23984ebcad765fc3689b9ce5e2b1d39a642a449f1ff11e176968067e161db07d","ja":"そうだね……うん！\nたしかにそれだったら……。","zh":"你说得对……嗯！\n确实如果是那样的话……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1300.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"29de35e0454b390c9953905672d943cfa3cc07bba3ce3962bf38f035453fc613","ja":"いや……今回はダンスだけでいかない？　だって、\nせっかくプロと対戦できるチャンスなんだからさ。","zh":"不……这次只比跳舞怎么样？毕竟，\n好不容易才有机会和专业人士对战嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1300.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"7d49f093837effe5d1f96797a509664d8e5493a516d5c64448ed9b2d42d184c0","ja":"アタシたちのダンスがどれくらい通用するか、\n試してみたいんだ！","zh":"想试一试我们的舞蹈\n究竟能发挥出多大水平！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1300.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"bc1f0f6257885ff06bb2c25e6a10014f9272a7ed6d0b99eb179495379bed404e","ja":"ふふっ……そうね。あんなやつら、\n伊織ちゃんの歌声がなくても勝ってみせるわ！","zh":"呵呵……也是呢。就算没有\n伊织的歌声，我也赢给那种家伙看！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1300.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"b7b5b2b66c4fc7b038f1891c8e853c9747ff376e45695eabbc11443df8fd31af","ja":"伊織ちゃんったら、さっきまで驚いてたのに♪\nでも、私も賛成。私たちの凄さを見せてあげましょ！","zh":"伊织真是的，明明刚才还那么惊讶♪\n不过，我也赞成。就让他们见识见识我们的厉害吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1300.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"17686e9780f5f1f8fb13b7b01565e7de7598eef0d409f4a4f912e477ddbc6f9b","ja":"みんな、サンキュー！\nそれじゃあこれから本番まで、しっかり特訓だ！","zh":"谢谢大家！\n那么在正式演出前，好好特训一番吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
